<div style='text-align:center;margin:20px 0'><img src='/講義/_svg/tkz_triangle.svg' style='max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)' alt='tkz_triangle'></div>

<div class="lf-h1">🤖 <div class="lf-h1"><span>🪤</span> 陷阱診斷專區 — 高品質陷阱題</div>
    <p>以下題目由AI教研團隊精心設計，每題針對一個常見考試陷阱。做完即知你的陷阱弱項！</p>
    <div class="lf-trap-section">
        <div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T1" data-hq-id="LF-T1-AI">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T1</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T1-AI</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">小明有12元，他買了一支鉛筆用了3元5角，又買了一塊擦膠用了2元8角。他還剩下多少元？</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >常見錯誤：12 - 3.5 - 2.8 = 5.7，所以答案是5.7元。學生直接用小數計算，忘記了元與角的單位換算，或誤將3元5角當作3.5元、2元8角當作2.8元，但正確應考慮元角進制，或直接以角計算。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >正確答案：5元7角。解釋：先將所有金額轉為角：12元 = 120角，3元5角 = 35角，2元8角 = 28角。120 - 35 - 28 = 57角，即5元7角。或分步：12元 - 3元5角 = 8元5角，8元5角 - 2元8角 = 5元7角。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 元角減法要小心，借位當十角記真真！</div>
            </div>
        </div><div class="lf-trap-card" data-trap="T2" data-hq-id="LF-T2-AI">
            <div class="lf-trap-header">
                <span class="lf-trap-badge">T2</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-diff">⭐⭐⭐</span>
                <span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T2-AI</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">一盒朱古力有24粒，姐姐吃了全部的1/4，弟弟吃了剩下的1/3，弟弟吃了多少粒？</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">常見錯誤</span>
                    <span >常見錯誤：1/4 + 1/3 = 7/12，24 × 7/12 = 14，所以弟弟吃了14粒。學生混淆了「全部的1/4」和「剩下的1/3」，直接將兩個分數相加。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-right">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">正確思路</span>
                    <span >正確答案：6粒。解釋：姐姐吃了24 × 1/4 = 6粒，剩下24 - 6 = 18粒。弟弟吃了剩下的1/3，即18 × 1/3 = 6粒。</span>
                </div>
                <div class="lf-trap-note">💡 「剩下」的幾分之幾，先減再乘不會錯！</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
<div class="lf-h1">AI 智能補充練習</div>
